# A skill /learn saved under ~/.kiln/skills loads at startup as a user
# skill (internal/claude/skills LoadSkills) and appears in the slash
# palette with its description.
@faux testdata/faux/qa/commands-baseline.yaml
@setup mkdir -p {HOME}/.kiln/skills/release-flow && printf -- '---\nname: release-flow\ndescription: Tag and publish a kiln release.\n---\n# Release flow\n' > {HOME}/.kiln/skills/release-flow/SKILL.md

WAITFOR /describe a task/ 20
TYPE /release
WAITFOR /release-flow/ 10
SHOT palette
EXPECT /\/release-flow.*Tag and publish a kiln release/
EXPECT_NOT /panic|goroutine/
